2. 6 independent mutants on a git-archive copy outside the repo, each restored with sha256 checked. KILLED:
- QA-A, read skips the root owner-only check (PS2, PS3);
- QA-B, write skips restricting the temp file (8 tests);
- QA-C, a junction root is accepted (PS3);
- QA-D, extra JSON fields are accepted (PP2b);
- QA-E, the version is not checked (PP2b).
