Route, with no rewrite, re-slice or re-land: the worker files the EPIC ADD_RAIL (issue 1) with moe.propose_rail and pings #governors with the prop id. Then a no-byte round: a fresh gate with the same command, then complete_task. QA parks while the proposal is PENDING and approves once it is APPROVED.

